---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Nav />
  
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-32 pt-48 px-4 bg-navy-900 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-normal">
          Our Thinking <br> <span class="text-primary">A Message to Industry Leaders</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Why PrimePoint Health is for You
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Healthcare Landscape Today Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">The Healthcare Landscape Today</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Healthcare is at a crossroads. Industry leaders face unprecedented pressures: rising costs, rapidly changing technology, evolving regulations, and the ever-present mandate to improve patient outcomes. There is also a growing expectation to address social determinants of health and ensure equity in care. The decisions leaders make today will determine whether their organizations thrive in this challenging environment or fall behind.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Perspective Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Our Perspective</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            At PrimePoint Health, we believe these challenges are surmountable – with the right strategy and bold leadership. Our perspective is shaped by firsthand experience leading change:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We've seen how data-driven, patient-centered innovations can improve quality while controlling costs.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We know that integrating care across silos – hospital, primary care, behavioral health, community services – is key to better outcomes.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We have proven that focusing on health equity and prevention not only serves communities but also strengthens organizational performance in the long run.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            The path forward requires vision and execution. It's about reimagining services, forging partnerships, and staying agile. Leaders must balance immediate operational needs with long-term transformation – all while keeping patients and communities at the center.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why It Matters for You Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Why It Matters for You</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            For healthcare executives and board members, the stakes have never been higher. Transformative change is not optional – it's a business imperative and a moral one. Patients expect more. Payers and regulators demand value. Competitors are emerging from unexpected corners with new models of care.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            This is where PrimePoint Health comes in:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We offer an independent viewpoint grounded in real-world leadership experience to help you make tough strategic choices confidently.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We act as a catalyst for change, equipping your team with the insights and tools needed to execute complex initiatives.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">check_circle</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  We ensure that improvements are not just theoretical but practical and sustainable, aligned with your organization's values and resources.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            By partnering with us, you gain a sounding board and strategy ally who understands the weight of your responsibilities. We know what it's like to sit in the CEO or COO chair making decisions that affect thousands of lives. Our thinking is always rooted in that reality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- A Partnership for Impact Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">A Partnership for Impact</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            PrimePoint Health is for leaders who refuse to accept the status quo. We are here to help you not only adapt to the changing landscape, but to shape it. Together, we can transform challenges into opportunities:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">arrow_forward</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Turn cost pressures into efficiency gains and reinvest savings into patient care.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">arrow_forward</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Turn fragmented systems into integrated networks that treat the whole person.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary font-bold shrink-0">arrow_forward</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Turn disparities into equitable outcomes, making your organization a model for inclusive excellence.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            We invite you to join us in this mission. As your consulting partner, PrimePoint Health will bring clarity amid complexity and momentum toward your most ambitious goals. The future of healthcare will be defined by the leaders who act today. Let's work together to ensure your organization is at the forefront of that future.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-navy-900 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Ready to Transform Healthcare?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8">
          Let's discuss how PrimePoint Health can help your organization thrive in today's challenging healthcare landscape.
        </p>
        <a href="#contact" class="inline-block bg-primary hover:bg-opacity-90 text-navy-900 font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-all">
          Get Started
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>